WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.216
Ernest, you're a good man,
aren't you?

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:12.554
Yes, sir. I am. I suppose so.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:17.434
You suppose so? [stammers]
Are you or aren't you?
[chuckles]

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.769
I am, sir. I am.

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.354
You love your wife and children?

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.274
Yes, sir. I do.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.443
You served your country
in infantry and--

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:29.237
and I don't think
this is how your life
was meant to turn out.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:37.871
Now, it seems to me
your family back home,

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:44.002
they're more of a blessing
to you than your uncle,
King Bill Hale.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:52.010
You and I both know
he presents himself
as a very righteous man.

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.015
And that's just not who he is.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.896
He's done nothing for you,
son...

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.274
except...

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.943
make you do bad things

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:12.614
and take advantage of you
because of your... disposition.

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.663
So what do you say
we start over?

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.419
I, uh...

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:32.050
I wanna get home to see my wife,

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.386
so you, uh...

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.890
you tell me what I gotta do.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:45.355
You know who killed Henry Roan?

